    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(This jailer's a mighty one too. She's just guarding, though, seems like. I wonder why...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heagh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(Crud, the jailer's down...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(Just me left. But if I end up fighting with him here, it's gonna be a mess to explain after.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(Think, c'mon. Is my only option to throw fists?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#3",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(Anthony... rescued me?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I might not know who you are, but you shouldn't be doing this. Not this, right in front of my eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh heh, death's knocking and you still care about other folk. You're a real gentleman, Mr. Anthony."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(When did he—?!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heheh. Here, miss. Don't be scared of me. Just blame it on your rotten luck."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Relax. Asides from Anthony, we don't wanna kill nobody. You just take a lie-down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_451_robin#2",
      "operatorId": "char_451_robin",
      "portraitKey": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "(Shit!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(He got me...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(I can't—think clear...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...let's...you a warm welcome...Anthony..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...dead..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "I didn't expect you to be this good of a cook. Wow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#4",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "Hm-hmm! Betcha didn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Anyway, she got caught up in another assassin's attempt and lost consciousness, then...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "That must've sucked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#1",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "Yeah, unlucky her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "So how'd this assassination pan out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "We know Anthony must've won, but this was an attempt on his life in a prison. Couldn't have gone without comment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "Yup. But because Robin was out during that time, we have to go from Kafka's side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Ooh, but didn't Kafka get knocked out by that convict too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "Oh, she sandbagged that one. So she says."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerToken": "char_249_muesys_1",
      "operatorId": "char_249_muesys",
      "portraitKey": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Ah... okay, that adds up. It does seem like her style, yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Talk. Whose people sent you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh... heh... you wouldn't... know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_133",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...He's out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "These people really were..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...Fine. Thinking about it now won't do anything. Let's see how these prisoners are first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Prisoners",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Looks like none of them crossed the river."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "And then this girl..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I don't know who you are, but you helped me back there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Thank you, girl stranger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can call me Kafka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Hm? You're not out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Uh. Don't move. Just shift a bit to the right. Block the monitors."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Is this okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Golden. Surveillance shouldn't see me now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Lucky for me, I checked around while I was cleaning the rooms."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "I told you, call me Kafka. I'm here to help you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "But this is a real snafu. I was gonna leave you a slip of paper and call it there. Didn't expect those guys to suddenly go off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "What in the world is happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Not the right place to talk about that. Know anywhere good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...The jailers should be coming over to see what the ruckus was. We can go to the clinic. That'll work."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What in blue blazes?! Anthony, what the hell are you doing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "That's what I'd like to ask, Barton."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "These prisoners snuck in with the intent to kill me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "What the hell are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_136#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's the truth, Superintendent Barton. I witnessed Mr. Anthony fight off two inmates."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What? Weren't you watching them?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_136#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The two of them knocked me out. They were quite... no, very strong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rgh. Good for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How do you want me to explain all this to the Warden?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Let's get a grip on the present first, Barton."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "These two are the assassins. You can deal with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A—hem. Right, but Mr. Anthony, you see, we can't just take you at your word for all of this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I've suffered minor injuries. I need a trip to the clinic first. They knocked everyone else unconscious. It might behoove you to send them all to the clinic too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Once we're there, I will explain things in fine detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_135#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you bunch navel-gazing for? Throw these two bodies in the morgue, and drag all of THEM with you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_134",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Y-Yes, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_137#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "The jailers're all gone, Anthony."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "What happened? I saw them all looking perturbed some."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I'd like to know too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Alright. This place is safe, young Kafka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Domma is my friend. If I could call anyone in this prison trustworthy, it'd be her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "First off, drop that 'young.' I'm just some random li'l shortie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Apologies, Miss Kafka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Man, okay, you. For a prisoner, you're politer than all the people outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "This's how Anthony is. He don't hold back courtesy for anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Yeah, I get it. You look like a haymaker, but you've got manners for days too. Not surprising everyone else in here thinks you're a juggernaut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "You flatter me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Well, then. My turn to ask the questions. You're apparently here to aid me. That means you know where my assassins came from, I suppose?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Uhh... before that, I need to ask you something first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "You know what your family—or I guess your dad is the one Simon Co.'s named after—anyway, do you know exactly what happened there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "As long as you do, I can explain things a lot simpler."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "My father was detained on more than ten charges. I know the circumstances couldn't have been simple, but I've had no time to find out concretely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Okay, you know, yeah. That's good enough for me. Um, Simon Co., uh... thanks to ille... il... whawazzit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Do you mean, 'illicit?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Yeah, that! Illicit, smuggling, of Originium, goods! Anyway, the company got shut down, and the core members all went to prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "So your whole family's serving in Bunkerhill City right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "Anthony..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...I'm alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I prepared myself to hear this a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I'm already happier than you could believe, knowing they're not dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Alright. Who sent them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "HydeBro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "HydeBro. So it was you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Lemme just think. What did Silence say... Right, your family. The Simons. Were competing with them across some kind of line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "You were camping 50% of the profits each over this. And there was plenty of friction. So they always wanted to just camp your share too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "And then they did it. Pretty simple."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...HydeBro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I heard my father mention that name often. I even visited their company as a guest once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "They did all of this over a bit of selfishness..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I'd heard of similar events before. I just never expected it'd happen around me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "Anthony. Are you alright? Need me to use my Arts, settle your mind some?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "No, thank you, Domma."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I told you, I prepared myself for this long ago. I didn't expect the reality to come so sudden, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I believe you, Miss Kafka. I think there's no reason you'd have to deceive me about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Seeing how things are, those assassins ought to be from HydeBro. Why only come at this point?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "That, I have no idea at all. But judging by my experience, that wasn't the last of them just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "They've sent a whole bunch of people in to take you out for sure, so, uh, we should probably call this the very beginning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "How about you? I presume you're not here just to help fend these killers off for me, are you? What's your objective, Miss Kafka?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Me? Mmm... it's kinda tough to explain fast, but let's say this: someone trusts me to help you break outta here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "You do wanna get out and take revenge, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "You got a life sentence. And it's the kind without parole."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "If you wanna leave this place, then you've got one choice, and that's—jailbreak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "And that's why I'm here to help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Obviously, if you don't wanna peace out and you're gonna stay here forever, it's not like I'm gonna force you to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "Jailbreak... but no soul has ever made a clean escape from this prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Eyy. Say that if you want. But you can't knock it till you try it, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "...You've been in this prison for a good while now, Miss Kafka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Hm? Yeah, sure have."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Then you should have heard some things about me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Yup. They all say you're the most powerful prisoner, and the most free. Pretty much everyone thinks you're strong as heck."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "I think you're pretty strong too, right now. Staying calm in times like these."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "But fact is, that's not what's happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Even with all this supposed 'charisma' I have, as a prisoner, I can't bend the jailers, let alone the warden. I should never have earned my current standing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Eh, that's true enough. But you earned it now, so hey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "In reality, what I've earned is the turnkeys' favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "At least, what little I know is that the warden himself said it. He told them to be 'slightly nicer' with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "All these years, I've had suspicions. After I reached Ironforge City, I was arrested. Then I came to this prison. Did my father arrange for this from the start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Foreseeing something, and sending me here in advance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Such things have always spun in my mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Oh, Silence mentioned that too. She said it was just one possibility, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Silence. Is that the name of your backer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "speakerToken": "char_214_Kafka_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_214_Kafka",
      "portraitKey": "char_214_Kafka",
      "text": "Uh... whelp, whatever. Yeah, it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I'll be sure to thank this friend afterwards."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Anyway, it's just one possibility as you say. If I want to know the reason for sure, I'll need to get out. This is something only I can shine a light on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Domma",
      "speakerToken": "char_441_lotus_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_441_lotus",
      "portraitKey": "char_441_lotus",
      "text": "Anthony, is it really alright to tell her this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "It's fine. I believe you for the moment, Miss Kafka. Thus, I'm willing to level with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Even if you didn't show up—even if I'd long since gotten used to life in this prison—I've still yearned, incessantly, to leave here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "I can obtain most of what I want in here. But not since the beginning have I found the faintest outline of how to get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "So in truth, I should be the one asking you, Miss Kafka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "speakerToken": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "portraitKey": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "Please, help me break out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
